# Secrets never enter the build context (.env.local would also override build args)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Tests and local output
**/e2e
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/coverage
**/shots
**/*.log
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
